  "description": "This client library is the base package for the Azure Storage Data Movement library. The Azure Storage Data Movement library is designed for high-performance, multi-threaded uploading, downloading and copying Azure Storage blobs and files.\n      This library is inteneded to be used with one or more of the Data Movement sub-packages, such as Azure.Storage.DataMovement.Blobs or Azure.Storage.DataMovement.Files.Shares.\n      For this release see notes - https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/blob/main/sdk/storage/Azure.Storage.DataMovement/README.md and https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/blob/main/sdk/storage/Azure.Storage.DataMovement/CHANGELOG.md",
